      "writtenOn": "2024-07-01T17:26:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would expect overflow to crash on some hwasan target and therefor, if we are expecting this scenario, it may be better to handle it gracefully instead.\n\n@henrichataing@google.com, you recently fixed a case of crash due to overflow. Do you know if this apply here ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 49
      },
      "revId": "70eb745ab84abd397b766a5c5543a5234ec81946",
